  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4560</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1001</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Beryl&gt;はさ、ソーマを
どこで手に入れたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you're a Somatic too, &lt;Beryl&gt;?
How’d you get yours?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Official: A Brush with Culture</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4684</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1002</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふっふ〜ん、このソーマは
一流画家である師匠が
ボクに譲ってくれたものなのさ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe~! This Soma was bestowed upon me by my teacher―a master of the arts!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1003</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>無粋な武器型とは違う
文化的な逸品でしょう？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My brush is way more cultured than
all those nasty barbaric weapons,
don’t ya think?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5160</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1004</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……筆でボッコボコに叩くのが
文化的なのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Never knew whacking people
upside the head with a brush was cultured.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5500</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C1005</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふ〜ん、い〜のさっ！
『筆は剣より強し』って言うだろ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph, of course it is!
Haven’t you ever heard the saying,
“the brush is mightier than the sword?!”</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
